ause delayed alerts, missed clips, and unreliable live view.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Can renters use a video doorbell?</summary><p class="faq-answer">Battery models are usually easier for renters, but mounting rules vary. Use non-permanent mounts only if they are secure and permitted by your lease or building rules.</p></details>
